      "widgets_values": [
        "## Wan 2.2 Turbo 5B - TEXT TO VIDEO\n\nNo image needed. Type a prompt and press **Run**.\n\n**Defaults that work on this laptop (6 GB VRAM):**\n- 704 x 480, 81 frames (3.4 s @ 24 fps), 4 steps, CFG 1.0\n- About **2.5 min** per clip\n\n**Speed tips**\n- 49 frames instead of 81 = roughly half the time.\n- 640 x 352 is the next step down in cost.\n- Keep steps at 4 - this is the 4-step Turbo model.\n\n**Negative prompt:** there is none on purpose. CFG 1.0 ignores it, and having\na second text-encode node costs about 60 s per run on this machine.\n\nModels used: Wan22-Turbo-Q4_K_M.gguf, umt5-xxl-encoder-Q4_K_M.gguf, wan2.2_vae.safetensors"
      ],
      "title": "Read me",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
